create the leather goods
  aka leather-goods, goods, riding equipment, equipment, display, displays, fare, wares, merchandise, leatherware
  scenery, plural
  in the Leather Stall

  This merchant mostly deals in riding equipment — reins, harnesses,
  stirrups, and the like. A full riding saddle sits on proud display near
  the back. There are a few scabbards and belts for sale, as well.

  on the player taking
    refuse sticky-fingers
  end on

  on the player smelling
    phrase leather-smell
  end on

create the riding saddle
  aka saddle, saddles, full saddle, polished saddle, lacquered saddle
  scenery
  in the Leather Stall

  The saddle is made of many layers of leather, shaped into sweeping curves
  and polished and lacquered until it gleams.

  on the player taking
    refuse saddle-too-huge
  end on

create the collective reins
  aka reins display, ordinary reins, riding reins display
  scenery, a supporter, plural
  stall-display
  in the Leather Stall

