define phrase jar-still-there
  You check the jar: yep, the weeds are still in there.
end phrase

define phrase jar-closed
  The jar is closed; those weeds aren't going anywhere.
end phrase

## `story.ni:2760` reads "You can't put [the noun] in the jar" — the inserted
## item cannot be named from a container's clause, so "that" stands in
## (deviation 7 in the story header's list).

define phrase jar-keeps-weed
  You can't put that in the jar; you keep your weed in there.
end phrase

define phrase weeds-spill
  They'd just spill everywhere.
end phrase

